  data: {
    LLM: "Keep a very close eye on the center foundations. The moment a rank appears that you have on your discard pile, play it immediately. Speed is everything.\n\nOffensive Filling: Use every opportunity to dump your cards onto your opponents' discard piles. This 'buries' their useful cards and gets you closer to winning.\n\nTrap Playing: If you have a card that could go to the center, but playing it would help your opponent more than you (e.g., they have the next card in sequence), try to delayâ€”but be careful not to get 'Juse'd'!",
